practACE - Track and Report Mechanism




Functions:


Add Task
The button will be redirected to the daily schedule, it helps to add a task for that particular date which cannot be older than the current system date (Today).


Allocation Channel - Study
When the mode is idle and the study button is clicked it shall activate the study mode, and when the study mode is on - and study button was clicked it shall move to idle, stop the time allocation to the linked task.


Milestones
Each milestone holds targets for a particular time period which is a minimum of 1 day. Based on the internal allocation, the total milestone targets will be moved across the days fixed for the milestone. Allocation across the days are shown in the daily Schedule of that particular date and also to the relevant weekly plan.


24 Hour Target Clock
List of all the targets on the active date in the daily schedule shall be linked to the slot system in the 24 hour target clock. The slots shall only be placed upon the user’s action and not automatically. The dropdown in slot shall hold the targets available for slot.


Daily Schedule
The page in the Daily Targets tab, where the targets with respect to the respective days were added and shown.


Target Board
Shall display all the targets on the daily schedule of the active date on the focus timer.
Based on the time slotted in the 24 hour target clock, the aggregate of the time slotted for that particular task shall be shown as total planned time for the task in there.


Focus Button
Allows user to link the task for which the focus is clicked from the target board shall add the task to the target slot, turns on the study more and accumulation begins


Target Slot
The active task currently being under process with planned time, completed time and pending time. The planned time and the accumulated time shall be same as the what it is mentioned along with the target board of that particular task
Unlink button in the target slot.


24 Hour Daily Balance clock
The visualisation of the ledger logs available for the particular active date on the focus time tab.
All the logs added in Ledger History shall be linked to here for visual presentation based on the time frame of the log and allocation channel.


Revision Report
The report of all the study allocation where the status of the chapters of respective subjects shall be maintained as either completed, partially done, skipped or not done(blank).
The logs added from the study allocation with respect to such subject and chapter of the respective relevance like baseline or revision or LMR in accordance to the task and process flow shall be presented.


Start Focused Study 
The button available in the Target slot when there is a particular task linked to the slot and used to resume the task which is started through linking but not marked complete.


________________


Procedural flow:


Scenario 1: No Linked Task and fresh start of a task but not completed.
Step 1: When the focus button is clicked for a target in the target board then the target shall be added to the target slot parallelly study mode is turned on.
Step 2: When the target is added to the target slot, it shall start accumulating the time for that task by keeping in consideration of the planned time update it real time in the target board of the task too (to put it simple the accumulation being recorded in the target slot is the extended link to the same task in the target board)
Step 3: When the study button is clicked in the allocation channel, then the time accumulation shall pause, time accumulated till then shall be logged in the ledger history.
Step 4: The Ledger log shall be linked to the 24 hour daily balance clock
Step 5:The ledger log shall be added to the revision report unless it is not a digital study block and the log shall be placed in the respective block either baseline or revision or LMR based on the task added


Scenario 2(1): Task where it stopped as per Scenario 1 resumed from target slot but not completed
Step 1: resume the study of the pending target from the Start focused study button from the target slot.
Step 2: resume the time accumulation as a fresh log but the time of the new log shall be appended and not clobbed. I.e., the accumulated time shall not be disturbed and the resume in the accumulation of the time shall be added to the accumulation.
Step 3: When the study button is clicked in the allocation channel, then the time accumulation shall pause, time accumulated till then shall be logged in the ledger history.
Step 4: The Ledger log shall be linked to the 24 hour daily balance clock
Step 5:The ledger log shall be added to the revision report unless it is not a digital study block and the log shall be placed in the respective block either baseline or revision or LMR based on the task added


