Scenario 2(3): Task where it stopped as per Scenario 1 resumed from the grind - target board but not completed
Step 1: resume the study of the pending target from the Grind button from the Allocation channel.
Step 2: resume the time accumulation as a fresh log but the time of the new log shall be appended and not clobbed. I.e., the accumulated time shall not be disturbed and the resume in the accumulation of the time shall be added to the accumulation.
