Scenario 3: Fresh task linked and marked complete
Step 1: When the focus button is clicked for a target in the target board then the target shall be added to the target slot parallelly study mode is turned on.
Step 2: When the target is added to the target slot, it shall start accumulating the time for that task by keeping in consideration of the planned time update it real time in the target board of the task too (to put it simple the accumulation being recorded in the target slot is the extended link to the same task in the target board)
Step 3: When the Done button from the target slot block is clicked, then the time accumulation for the task linked shall stop, Status of the task in the target board shall be updated to completion, time accumulated till then shall be logged in the ledger history.
Step 4: The Ledger log shall be linked to the 24 hour daily balance clock & Status in the 24 hour target clock shall be marked complete.
Step 5:The ledger log shall be added to the revision report unless it is not a digital study block and the log shall be placed in the respective block either baseline or revision or LMR based on the task added and once the log is placed mark the target as done.


Scenario 4(1): Task where it stopped as per Scenario 1 resumed from target slot and marked complete
Step 1: resume the study of the pending target from the Start focused study button from the target slot.
Step 2: resume the time accumulation as a fresh log but the time of the new log shall be appended and not clobbed. I.e., the accumulated time shall not be disturbed and the resume in the accumulation of the time shall be added to the accumulation.
Step 3: When the Done button from the target slot block is clicked, then the time accumulation for the task linked shall stop, Status of the task in the target board shall be updated to completion, time accumulated till then shall be logged in the ledger history.
Step 4: The Ledger log shall be linked to the 24 hour daily balance clock & Status in the 24 hour target clock shall be marked complete, the status of the target in the daily schedule shall be marked complete, then the status in weekly planner and target status in the milestone shall be marked complete.
Step 5:The ledger log shall be added to the revision report unless it is not a digital study block and the log shall be placed in the respective block either baseline or revision or LMR based on the task added and once the log is placed mark the target as done.




